  "titles": {
    "_tiers_note": "Fused Norse-Nahuatl clanhold, ascending; the titles blend the two (Norse jarl/konungr + Aztec tecuhtli/tlatoani). Hertekw (war-lord) barony; Yaomark (border war-chief) march; Tecujarl (lord) county; Tlacafylk (war-leader) duchy; Kontlatl (war-king) principality; Hueykonr (great war-king) kingdom; Cemkonr (the all-war-king) empire over Cem-Huitzgard. The blood-council and the warrior-societies check the war-kings. (Rank titles fuse the real Norse/Nahuatl register, allowed.)",
